<speak>Exactly. She asked why certain papers went into a particular tray, and I realised the reason had disappeared years ago. We were following a routine because we had always followed it. There used to be a staff member who collected those papers, but he retired, and somehow the tray stayed. We had a good laugh about that. I told her she could question the routine without worrying that I would take it personally. I am trying to mean that when I say it.</speak>